      "value": "@{64873f159cf028090ce2c2e2|full_name}\n\nThis issue is affecting many users in the open beta, including myself. According to Ghost from the VRChat support team, the output log I sent has been forwarded to an engineer, and they are working on a potential fix.\n\nTony mentioned in the VRChat Discord that Fusl, who works on the API team at VRChat, requested that Tony create this Canny post and that this already has been fixed internally and awaiting review.\n\nTo answer your question, the issue is occurring consistently and affecting other users in the open beta. I suggest you consult your coworkers for more information.",
